        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1994 Sun Bowl\n- People: Priest Holmes\n- Organizations: Texas, Baltimore Ravens\n\nFacts:\n- The 1994 Sun Bowl was a college football bowl game played on December 29, 1994.\n- In the 1994 Sun Bowl, Texas trailed 31–21 midway through the fourth quarter and came back to win 35–31.\n- In the 1994 Sun Bowl, Priest Holmes's leap into the end zone scored the winning points for Texas.\n- Priest Holmes signed with the Baltimore Ravens as an undrafted free agent in 1997.",
